.Dd October 26, 2026
.Dt BARE-OPTIONS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm bare-options
.Nd bare options used by su, shutdown, and leave
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Bl -tag -width flag
.It Fl l
Start a login shell, as in su.
.It Fl
A login shell, as in su; read a shutdown time from standard input, as in shutdown.
.El
.Pp
The following options are available:
.Bl -tag -width hhmm
.It Ar hhmm
An absolute alarm time.
.It Cm \&+
An alarm time relative to now, as in leave.
.El
.Sh Formats
.Bl -tag -width flag
.It Cm +
A numeric formatting modifier, as in stat.
.It Cm -
Left-align a field, as in stat.
.El
